bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"橘枝词三首记永嘉风土 其一","author":"叶适","text":"蜜满房中金作皮，人家短日挂疏篱。\n判霜剪露装船去，不唱杨枝唱橘枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23225,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"薛严州挽词","author":"叶适","text":"瘴雨蛮烟尽扫清，钓台方轨净无藤。\n堪怜独立沧江上，不许朱轓更一登。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23226,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"薛景石兄弟问诗于徐道晖请使行质以子钱畀之","author":"叶适","text":"弹丸旧是吟边物，珠走钱流义自通。\n认得徐家生活句，新来栏典讳诗穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23227,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠孙十五道人","author":"叶适","text":"将军桥畔女仙家，年与钟馗宴与花。\n欲度世人无妙诀，睡长留日住檐牙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23228,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠通川诗僧肇书记","author":"叶适","text":"海阔淮深万里通，吟情浩荡逐春风。\n却寻斗水龙湫住，裁剪云烟字字工。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23229,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠蒋知县二首 其一","author":"叶适","text":"稳绊芒鞋尽室行，何曾遣吏向前迎。\n存斋尽问深深意，只此能存不用名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23230,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"